        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu noonie vati ũndũ ũseo mbee, kwĩ mũndũ kũtanĩa mawĩa make; nũndũ kyu nĩkyo kĩanda kyake: nũndũ nũũ ũla ũkamũete ĩngĩ one ũndũ ũkethĩwa ĩtina wake? ",
